{"id":"n1-183","title":"～ごとく (〜gotoku)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"To seem like; as if; as though.","longExplanation":"The ～ごとく grammar point is used to express similarity or resemblance. It is quite formal/literary, meaning 'as if,' 'as though,' or 'like.' It can be used with verbs and nouns.","formation":"Verb-て + ごとく / Noun + の + ごとく","examples":[{"jp":"彼は鳥のごとく飛んでいるように見えた。","romaji":"Kare wa tori no gotoku tonde iru you ni mieta.","en":"He looked as though he was flying like a bird.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"鳥","vocabId":"1430250","reading":"とり"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ごとく","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ごとし"},{"surface":"飛ん","vocabId":"1429700","reading":"とぶ","baseForm":"飛ぶ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"よう","vocabId":"1546200","reading":"よう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見え","vocabId":"1259140","reading":"みえる","baseForm":"見える"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"彼は死んだごとく眠っていた。","romaji":"Kare wa shinda gotoku nemutte ita.","en":"He was sleeping as though he were dead.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"死ん","vocabId":"1310730","reading":"しぬ","baseForm":"死ぬ"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ごとく","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ごとし"},{"surface":"眠っ","vocabId":"1529390","reading":"ねむる","baseForm":"眠る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,6]},{"jp":"彼女はアイドルのごとく崇められている。","romaji":"Kanojo wa aidoru no gotoku agamerarete iru.","en":"She is revered as if she were an idol.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"アイドル","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ごとく","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ごとし"},{"surface":"崇め","vocabId":"1372840","reading":"あがめる","baseForm":"崇める"},{"surface":"られ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"られる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,7]},{"jp":"彼は風のごとく走った。","romaji":"Kare wa kaze no gotoku hashitta.","en":"He ran like the wind.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"風","vocabId":"1499720","reading":"かぜ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ごとく","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ごとし"},{"surface":"走っ","vocabId":"1402540","reading":"はしる","baseForm":"走る"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]}]}